{"availability":"available","full":"manaskg/Mood-Sync","name":"Mood-Sync","description":"Real-time facial expression music curation that dynamically generates and plays tailored soundscapes based on how you feel","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-05T00:05:18Z","updated":"2026-10-10T17:47:38Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://moodysync.netlify.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://moodysync.netlify.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T13:31:40.398Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T13:31:40.398Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T13:31:40.398Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T22:54:47.701Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T05:47:52.223Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T07:57:29.341Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T13:31:40.398Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Real-time facial expression music curation that dynamically generates and plays tailored soundscapes based on how you feel.","MoodSync is a full-stack, emotion-aware music streaming application designed as a flagship portfolio project. Utilizing on-device computer vision through Google MediaPipe FaceLandmarker, MoodSync analyzes subtle facial micro-expressions (smiles, frowns, jaw drops, brow movements) in real time to categorize the user's emotional state into Happy, Sad, or Surprised moods.","The application loads a curated playlist tailored to that emotion, dynamically shifting the application's ambient lighting and audio atmosphere to match the user's vibe."],"features":["🏠 Minimalist Landing Page (/):","Clean editorial hero section with harmonic soundwave contour graphics.","Overview of the three sonic states and how on-device biometric processing operates.","Instant navigation to the sound studio at /detect.","🧠 Facial Emotion Vision Studio (/detect):"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/manaskg/Mood-Sync/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7d06f586446e2331f4ad5